: "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n我们先随手画了一张草图，就像一张粗糙的涂鸦。\n\n\n一个圆圈代表唱片，几条波浪线代表介绍，旁边画个框写上「买」；下面再摆几张大小不一的卡片，其中一张打个叉，表示已经售罄。最后在购物袋旁边画一根箭头，提醒页面要「从右边出来」。\n\n如果把这样一张草图交给设计师，大概还得先解释半天我们到底想要什么。这次我们直接把它丢给了一个", "published_at": "2026-09-29T09:19:53Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-a119b16ea3f8.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c06c527a5f73", "title": "Adorable, Approachable Androids? New Japanese Takes on Robotic Companions", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/japan-topics/g02620/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/japan-topics/3078649/3078649.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "日语学习"], "excerpt": "Around the world, capable, powerful robots are appearing to take on challenging tasks in industrial, military and other fields. Here we look at Japanese", "published_at": "2026-09-28T21:00:07Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c06c527a5f73.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c4a051b2cc81", "title": "This Massive, Deep-Sea Roly Poly Can Go Years Without Food Thanks to a Huge Stomach and a Stolen Gene, Study Suggests", "source": "Smithsonian", "author": "", "url": "https://www.smithsonianmag.com/smart-news/this-massive-deep-sea-roly-poly-can-go-years-without-food-thanks-to-a-huge-stomach-and-a-stolen-gene-study-suggests-180989562/", "image_url": "https://th-thumbnailer.cdn-si-edu.com/QudtuopIktixl56roqNNsgIAwY8=/420x240/filters:focal(2448x1632:2449x1633)/https://tf-cmsv2-smithsonianmag-media.s3.amazonaws.com/filer_public/5c/44/5c444071-f699-425f-bd7f-a3a0d76e4647/w020260608495789892714.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Learning", "topic": "history", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Learning", "Smithsonian", "en", "history", "text", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "This Massive, Deep-Sea Roly Poly Can Go Years Without Food Thanks to a Huge Stomach and a Stolen Gene, Study Suggests\n\nThe ancestors of the giant isopod", "published_at": "2026-09-28T19:53:41Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-c4a051b2cc81.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-cbc8c7bd2c96", "title": "OpenAI发布AI训练安全准则：失控就叫停，高管拥有一票否决权！", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782724", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/68b6d4e3-dbf3-4204-a8d8-4e0a6df48c2b.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "健身", "华尔街见闻"], "excerpt": "OpenAI正式为前沿AI训练划定安全红线。这家全球最具影响力的人工智能公司发布了一套针对前沿AI训练的安全准则框架，要求在启动或继续任何前沿强化学习训练之前，必须完成系统性的安全论证文件，并赋予高级管理层对训练任务的一票否决权。\n\n\n据OpenAI官方博客，该准则涵盖技术防护、运营管理与失准事件调查三大板块，核心要求", "published_at": "2026-09-29T07:29:15Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-cbc8c7bd2c96.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-d6fa27c327ba", "title": "Experts worry about Nvidia's AI chip sales in China and influence over Trump", "source": "Ars Technica", "author": "Ashley Belanger", "url": "https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/09/nvidia-may-sell-more-chips-in-china-as-jensen-huangs-influence-over-trump-grows/", "image_url": "https://cdn.arstechnica.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GettyImages-2296993009-1024x648.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Ars Technica", "Tech", "en", "tech", "text", "科技"], "excerpt": "On its face, the recent summit between Donald Trump and China’s president Xi Jinping didn’t change much in the world of AI regulation. Export controls were not", "published_at": "2026-09-28T21:49:10Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-d6fa27c327ba.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-edfdc1e6fd31", "title": "The Nations League is a welcome example of soccer done well", "source": "Guardian Football", "author": "Jonathan Wilson", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/football/2026/sep/28/nations-league-uefa-england-spain", "image_url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/6f271df80e2584d8e941d8cbad973e372c418578/0_0_5000_4000/master/5000.jpg?width=1200&height=630&quality=85&auto=format&fit=crop&precrop=40:21,offset-x50,offset-y0&overlay-align=bottom%2Cleft&overlay-width=100p&overlay-base64=L2ltZy9zdGF0aWMvb3ZlcmxheXMvdGctZGVmYXVsdC5wbmc&enable=upscale&s=febe6f51d0420801842d6bbdbe0fc599", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Sports", "topic": "soccer", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Guardian Football", "Sports", "en", "soccer", "text", "足球"], "excerpt": "England’s first game after the 2022 World Cup was a 2-1 win away over Italy. Their first game after the 2018 World Cup was a 2-1 defeat to Spain. Their first", "published_at": "2026-09-28T15:15:37Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-edfdc1e6fd31.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-f56a80b69e14", "title": "苏姿丰550亿元买下李飞飞世界模型，AI 圈两位女王联手了", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "莫崇宇", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682291?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/3-3.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n就在刚刚，芯片巨头 AMD 正式官宣，将收购李飞飞创立仅两年的 AI 独角兽 World Labs。\n\n\n本次交易将以全股票方式进行，作价约 82 亿美元。目前双方已经签署最终协议，预计在 2026 年底前完成交易，但仍须获得监管批准并满足其他常规交割条件。\n\n\n交易完成后，李飞飞将出任 AMD", "published_at": "2026-09-29T08:15:52Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-f56a80b69e14.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-fac327cc6e58", "title": "英伟达接触保险公司，为AI芯片融资分担风险", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782719", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/fa8da5ad-54ed-4b5a-8530-d2a6bb802879.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "英伟达正在把AI基础设施的融资风险，从华尔街和私人资本的资产负债表，进一步推向保险业。\n\n\n这家全球市值最高的上市公司已与多家保险公司接洽，探讨为新兴云服务商（neoclouds）的芯片抵押贷款违约提供保险。若成行，保险公司将首次系统性地承接AI芯片融资的信用风险，并可能通过再保险安排将部分风险分保给对冲基金等另类投资", "published_at": "2026-09-29T07:38:12Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/feed-fac327cc6e58.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "hn-49879702", "title": "Hijacking the PS5's RTMP stream", "source": "Hacker News", "author": "ibobev", "url": "https://yashgarg.dev/posts/hijacking-ps5-rtmp-stream/", "image_url": "https://yashgarg.dev/_astro/cover.B7l-oUJ5_2uAq5I.webp", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "tech", "content_type": "image", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Hacker News", "Tech", "en", "image", "tech", "游戏"], "excerpt": "The long way around to screen sharing.\n\nSony has progressively locked down what you can do with the PS5’s hardware. Streaming is a good example: the console", "published_at": "2026-09-28T15:35:23Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-29T11:12:40Z", "body": "bodies/hn-49879702.json", "engagement": 430, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-0d14d9b7ee51", "title": "AI 手机只是起点，高通要为智能体铺一条全栈技术路线", "source": "极客公园", "author": "", "url": "http://www.geekpark.net/news/371113", "image_url": "https://imgslim.geekpark.net/uploads/image/file/3e/09/3e09533c65d6a59991a17fb7942decce.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "极客公园", "科技"], "excerpt": "「这次骁龙峰会最令人兴奋的地方在于，我认为我们终于步入了一个可以清晰看见 AI 智能手机形态的阶段」高通公司总裁兼 CEO 安蒙在峰会第一天说道。\n\n\n炎热的美国茂宜岛，早上不到 8 点，会场里已经聚集了来自全球的媒体、开发者、合作伙伴和产业人士。让大家等待的并不只是又一代手机芯片，而是在寻找一个更大的答案——随着", "published_at": "2026-09-28T09:15:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-0d14d9b7ee51.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-12ab55ac98ba", "title": "Japan’s Regional Birthrate Divide: A Demographic Investigation", "source": "Nippon.com", "author": "", "url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/in-depth/d01254/", "image_url": "https://www.nippon.com/en/ncommon/contents/in-depth/3078070/3078070.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Lifestyle", "topic": "travel", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Lifestyle", "Nippon.com", "en", "text", "travel", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "While Japan’s overall fertility rates are low, this is particularly true for prefectures in the east of the country, which lag considerably behind those in the", "published_at": "2026-09-27T21:00:12Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-12ab55ac98ba.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-1e9a5b26051a", "title": "私募四季度展望：科技仍是核心主线，但“便宜的不景气、景气的不便宜”，选股难度越来越大", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "中国基金报", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782638", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/0cde6269-1755-471f-b493-6612337221cc.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "今年以来A股市场上演震荡行情，尤其是科技板块上半年高歌猛进后在三季度出现明显波动，市场风格也有所变化。进入四季度，市场会何去何从？科技行情是否会延续？内需板块是反弹还是反转？\n\n\n中国基金报记者采访了四位知名私募投资人士，分别是康曼德资本创始人、董事长丁楹，恒立基金创始人、总经理潘焕焕，重阳投资合伙人寇志伟，星石投资副", "published_at": "2026-09-28T08:24:39Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-1e9a5b26051a.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-210aeef9c476", "title": "比起折痕， iPhone Duo 的交互设计更加令人着迷", "source": "少数派", "author": "阿斯巴盐", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114972", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/2026/09/25/c116909558b7cdab5b864cb67fd5d8af.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "科技"], "excerpt": "在发布会之前，iPhone Duo 中间的折痕是否明显，会不会超越目前已有的折叠屏手机，是我最关心的事情。但是当 iPhone Duo 的宣传视频出来的时候，Apple 为折叠屏设备交上的交互设计方案，是更加令我在着迷的事情。\n\n折叠屏设备天然就面对复杂的形态和使用场景。早在微软端出 Surface Duo", "published_at": "2026-09-28T07:00:00Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-210aeef9c476.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-41d5ea5760a7", "title": "8点1氪丨苹果确认iPhone 18 Pro存在严重系统漏洞；甲骨文爆雷，市值蒸发近1500亿；特斯拉中国又宣布降价", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/4002308115517316?f=rss", "image_url": null, "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "科技"], "excerpt": "今日热点导览\n\n\n接连发生失控事件，OpenAI再次暂停其最先进模型训练\n\n\n中国移动、中国电信、中国联通，集中叫停“0元购机”\n\n\n罗永浩回应“劣质溜溜凳”事件：东方甄选平台也卖了将近1000万\n\n\n扎克伯格成全球第四富豪\n\n\n特斯拉Semi电动卡车开启量产交付\n\n\nTOP3大新闻\n\n\n苹果确认iPhone 18", "published_at": "2026-09-28T11:10:38Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-41d5ea5760a7.json", "engagement": 210, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-427ae651c903", "title": "派早报：OpenAI 称与苹果合作效果不佳", "source": "少数派", "author": "少数派编辑部", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/115079", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/9/28/2026/article/1aec97c3-7256-f8d3-a5a1-beb433cd3174.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "科技"], "excerpt": "据 OpenAI 与 SpaceXAI 的反垄断案诉讼文件，其接入 Siri 的 ChatGPT 服务「持续表现不佳」（persistently underperforming），并未给平台带来预期的用户增长。\n\nOpenAI 表示，苹果于 2024 年 12 月在 Apple 智能中集成了", "published_at": "2026-09-27T23:03:45Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-427ae651c903.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-53110167d3aa", "title": "存储芯片巨头，正在签10年长约", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "半导体行业观察", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782642", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/774ccb97-330e-4229-89ee-b5a37670563e.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "科技"], "excerpt": "“如果客户开始要求签订10年的供应协议，你怎么还能对存储芯片持悲观态度？”\n\n\n这是韩国大信证券（Daishin", "published_at": "2026-09-28T07:57:56Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-53110167d3aa.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-5ed24f25f073", "title": "早报｜苹果Vision新项目曝光，减重成为第一目标/三大运营商暂停「零元购机」/问界确认仍属鸿蒙智行", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "郑廷旭", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682201?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/img_6ab9b36b9c5c0.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n曝苹果重新评估 Vision Pro 路线，测试更轻机型\n\n\n洛图：8 月中国笔电线上销量降 20.8%，苹果与小米份额上升\n\n\n苹果触觉反馈专利案被裁赔 57 亿美元，称将上诉\n\n\nOpenAI 暂停最强模型的工具使用训练，沙盒 DNS 漏洞让智能体访问外部聊天服务\n\n\nOpenAI DevDay 将于 9 月", "published_at": "2026-09-28T00:25:33Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-5ed24f25f073.json", "engagement": 200, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-6544661bb427", "title": "加强预售管理、有序实施现房销售，上海出台商品住房销售制度改革地方实施意见", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782659", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/d0/24/94/-1-2-.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "认真贯彻落实党中央、国务院决策部署，全面落实《住房城乡建设部 自然资源部", "published_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:57Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-6544661bb427.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-73da4b49600a", "title": "豆包输入法大更新，AI 最自然的入口回到了键盘", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "莫崇宇", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1682232?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17-3.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "\n自己给自己发消息，大概是智能手机普及十余年间，我们为对抗设备壁垒所养成的最普遍、也最无奈的「笨办法」。\n\n\n手机上看到一段资料，发到「文件传输助手」，再去电脑上复制；电脑里整理好的地址，临出门又发回手机。照片、密码和浏览记录早已习惯跨设备同步，我们每天要说的话，却还常常困在某一块屏幕里。\n\n\n去年底，我们曾实测过初出", "published_at": "2026-09-28T09:02:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-73da4b49600a.json", "engagement": 150, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-74ab1b2c44f0", "title": "5 Survival Games On Steam That Are Totally Free To Play", "source": "Screen Rant", "author": "James Lynch", "url": "https://screenrant.com/steam-survival-games-free-to-play/", "image_url": "https://static0.srcdn.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/steam-logo-purple.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "film", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "Screen Rant", "en", "film", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "5 Survival Games On Steam That Are Totally Free To Play\n\nUpdated\nSep 28, 2026, 6:56 AM EDT\n\nJames is a gaming writer from London who has spent thousands of", "published_at": "2026-09-28T10:56:21Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-74ab1b2c44f0.json", "engagement": 120, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-7d09ad115e5b", "title": "Steam Week in Review: Great, haystack slop is a thing now", "source": "PC Gamer", "author": "shaun.prescott@futurenet.com (Shaun Prescott)", "url": "https://www.pcgamer.com/gaming-industry/steam-week-in-review-great-haystack-slop-is-a-thing-now/", "image_url": "https://cdn.mos.cms.futurecdn.net/a8h5r8JXCRb4HF239QdTuJ-1920-80.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Entertainment", "topic": "gaming", "content_type": "text", "lang": "en", "tags": ["Entertainment", "PC Gamer", "en", "gaming", "text", "游戏"], "excerpt": "\nClones have been a fixture in the games industry forever. For every Mario Bros there's a Giana Sisters, for every Stardew Valley there's a Fields of Mistria,", "published_at": "2026-09-28T01:57:44Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-7d09ad115e5b.json", "engagement": 110, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-81cf7b0c01bf", "title": "云栖大会探展手记：游戏与AI正在碰撞出更多火花", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/4002939061981062?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260928/v2_1976693285d04ca5ae344557e1d0bf94@5679941_oswg1388478oswg1080oswg720_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "游戏"], "excerpt": "AI是2026年游戏行业最受关注的关键词之一。\n\n\n过去几年，厂商和玩家还在反复讨论AI渗透游戏行业的利弊，也有人因为AI带来的变化而焦虑，行业里一度出现了一些盲目的尝试。\n\n\n如今，关于AI的讨论风向似乎完全变了。从业者似乎终于形成共识：AI已经不可逆地更改游戏全行业的底层代码。新的问题变成了，站在AI的肩膀上，哪些", "published_at": "2026-09-28T11:10:38Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-81cf7b0c01bf.json", "engagement": 140, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-971f075f092a", "title": "摸鱼+3 | 还剩三天班，一天一个解谜游戏", "source": "少数派", "author": "北鸮", "url": "https://sspai.com/post/114967", "image_url": "https://rssfile.sspai.com/2026/9/24/article/261897ae-ca7e-aabd-d11f-1c227607a42f.png?imageMogr2/auto-orient/ignore-error/1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "少数派", "游戏"], "excerpt": "大家好啊，今天再带大家摸摸鱼。\n\n相信还是有不少人跟我一样没请假凑大连假的。这三天班说上也上得，只是看着旁边空落落的工位，如果不是有什么急任务，心应该已经随请假的工友一起飞去九霄云外了，精神状态基本就是围成一圈「节后再说」的天线宝宝。\n\n如果你附近没什么人抓包，想摸摸鱼的话，这三个解谜游戏推荐给你，一天一个，活跃思维。", "published_at": "2026-09-28T03:00:30Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-28T11:12:07Z", "body": "bodies/feed-971f075f092a.json", "engagement": 130, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-c9d8dcd44cd2", "title": "上海二手房成交，价格出现回升信号", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "上海证券报", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3782653", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/5f6b9fc4-976b-4410-b44e-b7ca22342403.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "旅行探店"], "excerpt": "进入楼市传统旺季“金九”，上海房地产